1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,031
Second, surfaces.

2
00:00:02,031 --> 00:00:14,309
The partly filled d orbitals and unsatisfied valencies on a metal surface adsorb gas molecules, hold them close together in the right orientation, and weaken their bonds.

3
00:00:14,309 --> 00:00:24,257
In the Haber process, nitrogen and hydrogen are adsorbed on iron, the strong nitrogen triple bond is loosened, and ammonia forms and leaves.

